OL,3,GUK long range forecast                 
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 9 Dec to Wed 23 DecFThe
OL,6,Ftussle between areas of low pressure   
OL,7,Ftrying to move in from the west and    
OL,8,Fhigh pressure to the northeast of the  
OL,9,Fcountry building more bodily across    
OL,10,Fthe UK is likely to continue during    
OL,11,Fthis period. Parts of the west and     
OL,12,Fsouth are most likely to see wetter    
OL,13,Fthan average conditions. Spells of     
OL,14,Fstrong winds remain a possibility, but 
OL,15,Foverall the chances of windy weather   
OL,16,Fare lower than normal for early        
OL,17,Fwinter. Given this broader setup, the  
OL,18,Fchance of below average temperatures   
OL,19,Foverall is higher than normal,         
OL,20,Fespecially for areas towards the north 
OL,21,Fand northeast, where other winter      
OL,22,Fhazards such as snow and ice are also  
OL,23,Frelatively more likely. Milderet Office
OL,24,Finterludes are more likely towards theV
